{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and pick it. Then check object's properties. Or scan area for object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />",
